# ── OS / editor noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.*.sw?
*~

# ── Build / language caches ────────────────────────────────────────────
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
node_modules/

# ── Secret / key material ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Real secrets live as chezmoi `encrypted_*` source files (ciphertext,
# safe to commit) or as template pulls from a password manager.  The
# patterns below catch the plaintext forms that must never enter VCS.
**/key.txt
*.age
**/credentials.env
**/.env

# ── Local experimentation / scratch ────────────────────────────────────
# Conventional suffixes for work-in-progress trees kept outside git.
*.test/
*.ignore/
*.nosync/
